(* The driver of the JSON print of the case study @CS@ (see dune), generated
   by gen.sh from driver_json.v.in. Built for the alias predicate-viewer
   only; print_json (../print_json.v) is loaded as griotte_tools. *)
From griotte Require Import
  machine_base griotte_opsem switcher assert allocator_resources compartment_layout.
From griotte.case_studies.@DIR@ Require Import @CS@_firmware.
(* Imported last: the fields of the image records. *)
From griotte Require Import image firmware firmware_ok print.
From griotte_tools Require Import print_json.
From Ltac2 Require Import Ltac2.
Import FwPrintNotations FwRegNotations.
Import (notations) Stdlib.Strings.String.
Open Scope string_scope.
Open Scope OType_scope.
Open Scope Addr_scope.
Ltac2 Eval print_initial_state_json "@CS@" constr:(@@CS@_initial_state_ok_annot).
